{"availability":"available","full":"mindstellar/shopclass","name":"shopclass","description":"ShopClass: free, open-source, self-hosted classifieds software in PHP. Run a classifieds site, marketplace, job board, property or car listings. The modern successor to Osclass.","category":"Developer tools","language":"PHP","stars":107,"forks":55,"created":"2017-10-26T08:47:18Z","updated":"2026-10-11T18:06:22Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://mindstellar.com","topics":["classified-ads","classified-script","classifieds","classifieds-script","classifieds-software","cms","craigslist-clone","directory","job-board","listings","marketplace","mysql","open-source","osclass","php","real-estate","self-hosted","shopclass"],"demo":"https://demo.mindstellar.com/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:44.179Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:44.179Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:44.179Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T19:51:44.179Z","stars":107,"forks":55}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["ShopClass is a PHP application for running a listing site on your own hosting: listings with photos, categories and locations, custom fields per category, user accounts, search and filtering, paid plans, pages, multi-language support, and an admin panel to run it all. Classifieds is where it started; the same parts fit any site where people post and browse listings. It ships as a zip you install on ordinary shared or VPS hosting; there is no build step or bundler to run on the server.","ShopClass is the modernised, maintained successor to Osclass. It keeps Osclass's plugin and theme APIs (the osc helpers, hook names, and asset paths) so existing extensions keep working, while replacing the legacy frontend: a Bootstrap 5 admin theme, jQuery removed from the core, PHP 8 throughout, and a first-class maintenance/cleanup toolset built in.","Coming from Osclass? What happened to Osclass, and how to upgrade walks through the history, what carries over, and the upgrade path from a 3.x or 5.x install."],"features":["🗂️ Listings with photos, categories, and hierarchical locations","🧾 Custom fields per category, with inheritance, groups, and conditional logic","💳 Paid plans and listing upgrades: listing fees, photo limits, premium, bump, highlight","📄 Static pages with a page editor and page templates","🔍 Search, filtering, and SEO-friendly URLs"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mindstellar/shopclass/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"3a90c4ac298bb96d0f941b882d34eb090c0d13adec9b42765e3b14ef0d0f136a","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:44.333Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:44.333Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"ShopClass is a PHP application for running a listing site on your own hosting: listings with photos, categories and locations, custom fields per category, user accounts, search and filtering, paid plans, pages, multi-language support, and an admin panel to run it all. Classifieds is where it started; the same parts fit any site where people post and browse listings. It ships as a zip you install on ordinary shared or VPS hosting; there is no build step or bundler to run on the server.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mindstellar/shopclass/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"🔒 CSRF protection, CAPTCHA, admin two-step sign-in, and hardened sessions","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mindstellar/shopclass/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Sign in at with the admin password shown on the final screen.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mindstellar/shopclass/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"3a90c4ac298bb96d0f941b882d34eb090c0d13adec9b42765e3b14ef0d0f136a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mindstellar/shopclass/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:44.333Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T18:06:22Z","readmeSnapshot":{"versio